;. /business_workspace_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition business_workspace
  ;= Assemble a business evidence workspace
    Publish select_queries, capture_sources, decode_sources and project_sources
    independently first. This composition captures those exact definitions.
    Bind an endpoint catalogue and an explicit selection; the procedure has no
    database, query, entity name or page-size defaults. Its generic wiki is an
    editable starting point, not an inferred business schema.

    ;@ /flow/input catalogue
    ;= catalogue

    ;@ /flow/input selection
    ;= selection

    ;@ /flow/invoke urls ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/select_queries_flow/flows/select_queries
    ;@ /flow/bind catalogue catalogue
    ;@ /flow/bind selection selection
    ;= select_queries

    ;@ /flow/invoke captured ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/capture_sources_flow/flows/capture_sources
    ;@ /flow/bind urls urls
    ;= capture_sources

    ;@ /flow/invoke decoded ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/decode_sources_flow/flows/decode_sources
    ;@ /flow/bind sources captured
    ;= decode_sources

    ;@ /flow/invoke pages ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/project_sources_flow/flows/project_sources
    ;@ /flow/bind pages document
    ;@ /flow/bind sources decoded
    ;= project_sources

    ;@ /flow/result pages
    ;= Evidence workspace

    ;@ /flow/page /
    ;= Business evidence workspace
      This workspace projects explicitly selected evidence. Source-reference children retain the captured values; inspect the flow cells to compose with them.

    ;@ /flow/page overview
    ;= Scope and business context
      Record the business question, relevant dates and coverage here. A bounded capture is not a complete business model. Historical data requires an explicit business date.

    ;@ /flow/page model
    ;= Entities and relationships
      Select schema evidence before authoring domain mappings. Preserve keys, nulls, types and declared relationships. No universal customer, order or product schema is imposed by this flow.

    ;@ /flow/page records
    ;= Selected records
      The selected queries and their explicit arguments determine coverage. Keep paging bounds and source provenance visible. Different queries need not represent one database snapshot.

    ;@ /flow/page investigations
    ;= Investigations
      Create named child documents for questions, evidence and findings. Use the shared answering hand and retained attempts. Generated introductions do not own your investigation children.

    ;@ /flow/page procedures
    ;= Reusable procedures
      Discover and invoke the published component flows separately, or compose them with domain-specific validation and calculations. Deliberately publish changes; existing occurrences retain their selected definitions.
      ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/select_queries_flow
      ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/capture_sources_flow
      ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/decode_sources_flow
      ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/project_sources_flow
